    given-names: Francesco
repository-code: "https://github.com/Franski6325/MilitiaCelestial"
url: "https://github.com/Franski6325/MilitiaCelestial"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-07"
abstract: >
  MilitiaCelestial converts Sigma detection rules through pySigma into Wazuh 4.x
  analysisd XML. Skips that Wazuh cannot express are reported instead of
  guessed. SigmaHQ rules are not vendored. Community project, not affiliated
  with Wazuh Inc. or SigmaHQ.
keywords:
  - sigma
  - wazuh
  - pysigma
  - siem
  - detection-engineering
